---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import LegalEntity from '../components/shared/LegalEntity.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';

const mailto = `mailto:${company.privacyEmail}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Data deletion request')}`;

const sections = [
  { id: 'request', label: '1. Ask us to delete' },
  { id: 'facebook', label: '2. Remove our app in Facebook' },
  { id: 'what', label: '3. What we delete' },
  { id: 'keep', label: '4. What we may keep' },
  { id: 'confirm', label: '5. Confirmation' },
  { id: 'bizagent', label: '6. BizAgent users' },
  { id: 'contact', label: '7. Contact' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Data Deletion Instructions | InvigoSol"
  heading="Data Deletion"
  description="How to ask InvigoSol to delete your data, and how to remove InvigoSol apps that use Facebook Login for Business or the WhatsApp Business Platform."
  intro="You can ask us to delete the personal data we hold about you at any time, including data we received through Facebook Login for Business and the WhatsApp Business Platform."
  canonicalPath="/data-deletion"
  sections={sections}
>
  <h2 id="request">1. Ask us to delete your data</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={mailto}>{company.privacyEmail}</a> with the subject <strong>"Data deletion request"</strong>. Please send
    it from the email address linked to your account and include:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>the name of the app or service (for example, the app you connected with Facebook);</li>
    <li>the business name and, if relevant, the WhatsApp business phone number that was connected.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you write from a different address, we will ask you to confirm that you own the account before we delete anything.</p>

  <h2 id="facebook">2. Remove our app from your Facebook account</h2>
  <p>This stops the app from receiving any new data from Meta straight away.</p>
  <ol class="mt-2 list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-700">
    <li>Open Facebook and go to <strong>Settings &amp; privacy → Settings</strong>.</li>
    <li>Open <strong>Business integrations</strong> (or <strong>Apps and websites</strong>, depending on how you connected).</li>
    <li>Find the InvigoSol app (or BizAgent) and select <strong>Remove</strong>.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="mt-3">
    In <strong>Meta Business Suite → Settings → Integrations / Connected apps</strong>, an admin can also remove the app from the
    business portfolio and the WhatsApp Business Account. Removing the app revokes access, but it does not delete data we
    already hold. To delete that data, also send the request in step 1.
  </p>

  <h2 id="what">3. What we delete</h2>
  <p>Within <strong>30 days</strong> of a verified request, we permanently delete:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your account and profile data (name, email, Facebook user ID);</li>
    <li>connected business details (business portfolio ID, WhatsApp Business Account ID, phone number ID);</li>
    <li>access tokens and keys (deleted immediately);</li>
    <li>stored messages, media, message status data and templates;</li>
    <li>everything our apps generated from that data, such as summaries, categories and reports.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Encrypted backups are overwritten on their normal cycle and are not restored except for disaster recovery.</p>

  <h2 id="keep">4. What we may keep</h2>
  <p>
    We keep only what the law requires, such as invoices and payment records, and a short record that the deletion request
    was completed. These records are not used for any other purpose.
  </p>

  <h2 id="confirm">5. Confirmation</h2>
  <p>
    We email you when the deletion is complete.
  </p>

  <h2 id="bizagent">6. BizAgent users</h2>
  <p>
    If you use BizAgent, follow the instructions at
    <a href="https://bizagent.pk/data-deletion/">bizagent.pk/data-deletion</a>. BizAgent is also operated by {company.legalName},
    so a request sent to either address reaches the same team.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">7. Contact</h2>
  <LegalEntity />
  <p>See also our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
